SUMMARY:David Matters & Life Like Water
DESCRIPTION:Bar: 4PM – Deli: 4PM – Music: 6:00PMPisgah Brewing Company Taproom StageLife Like Water is the brainchild of David Matters and is a musical response to a radical shift in awareness. After many years of creating music through various projects (most notably the newgrass band Gipsy Moon) as well as a number of genre shifts\, his focus has narrowed and his vision has broadened. Life Like Water is a multi-colored tapestry of sounds and influences. With a focus on hypnotic rhythms\, heartfelt lyrics\, and melodies that contain flavors of Appalachia\, Africa and the Middle East\, the music of this eclectic ensemble is sure to uplift and inspire. \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates an indoor taproom and an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months with live music several days a week. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/david-matters-life-like-water/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
