CREATED:20260423T182427Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260504T131726Z
UID:10058952-1778094000-1778104800@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:The Aaron Austin Trio
DESCRIPTION:The Aaron Austin Trio (AA3) is defined by rich textures\, deep groove\, and soulful improvisation. Led by guitarist Aaron Austin\, the group draws inspiration from jazz legends like John Scofield and Bill Frisell\, blending tradition with a modern sensibility. Their sound weaves together the grit and energy of 1970s jazz-fusion with fresh\, imaginative takes on the American Songbook — all delivered through an improvisational lens that keeps every performance unpredictable and alive. With two of Asheville’s in demand players holding down the rhythm section; Jake Wolf on bass and Ted Marks on drums expect of night of emotive playing and locked in grooves sure to inspire. \n$10 weekdays -$15 weekends at the door (all ticket proceeds are 100% passed to the band\, backed by a living wage guarantee from Hotel Eve) \n*Reserve a table in advance\, or join us impromptu the night of the show. Reservations/advance tickets are recommended for preferred seating\, but not required. Tickets are available at the door on a first-come\, first-served basis.  Event Details and Tickets \nHotel Eve is your locally rooted\, speakeasy jazz club & cocktail bar\, hidden in the heart of Downtown Asheville. Mysteriously not a hotel…check in for spirits\, souls and jazz! We’re tucked away\, on purpose. You’ll find us behind the gate nestled between Virtue Boutique and Dane Wells Gallery at 56 N Lexington Avenue in downtown Asheville. Step through\, take a left into the courtyard\, check in for Spirits\, Souls & Jazz. We’ll be waiting on the other side. hotelevejazz.com \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/the-aaron-austin-trio/
LOCATION:Hotel Eve Jazz\, 56 N Lexington Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/684663562_17891353011467074_3567579138668254721_n-e1777900640671.jpg
GEO:35.5967716;-82.5530826
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Hotel Eve Jazz 56 N Lexington Avenue Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=56 N Lexington Avenue:geo:-82.5530826,35.5967716
END:VEVENT
