SUMMARY:Alien Music Club Trio (formerly My Magnificent Trio)
DESCRIPTION:Alien Music Club Trio is a nerdy/sexy/eclectic/genre-bending group featuring James Kylen (drums/vocals)\, Chuck Lichtenberger (keys/vocals) and Jonathan Pearlman (guitar/vocals). All three contribute original material along with diverse covers by artists as The Beatles\, Ozzy Osborne\, Radiohead\, Taylor Swift\, Katy Perry and much more\, with a generous dose of jazz standards by the likes of Miles Davis\, Sonny Rollins\, Wes Montgomery and more. You never know what to expect! You’ll love Alien Music Club Trio!
